<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Gartner Group to expand Irish operation.</title>
<headline>Gartner Group to expand Irish operation.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gartner Group, a U.S. subsidiary of Dun and Bradstreet Corp, is to expand its Limerick operations with the support of IDA Ireland, creating 125 new jobs over the next three years, the Irish government said.</p>
<p>Gartner provides information and advice on computer technology and its business applications.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
</text>
